# Tested versions\n\nReproducible in:\n- 4.5.beta6\n- 4.4.1\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.beta6 - macOS Sequoia (15.6.1) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Metal (Mobile) - integrated Apple M3 Max (Apple9) - Apple M3 Max (14 threads) - 36.00 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nEven with a custom image set in the iOS export settings for the storyboard launch screen, the Godot logo briefly appears when opening an exported Godot app on iOS:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/92f03802-bab1-43e3-ac25-0bb792bf2792\n\nThis is with a these export settings:\n\n<img width=\"582\" height=\"201\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a1a0710f-b08a-4404-8455-0f33d625b19a\" />\n\nAnd this happens regardless of whether the project settings' Boot Splash image is shown or not.\n\nDon't get me wrong, I love Godot, but I'd like to choose where to put the Godot logo if that's alright ;)\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nExport to iOS.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nn/a","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/